    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n37 Temple Gardens is a stunning three bedroom third floor apartment that comes to market in turnkey condition. Set in a quiet development amidst 75 acres of parkland, this fine home has everything you could look for in a modern home including an energy efficient B2 BER, three good sized bedrooms all with fitted wardrobes, two designated parking spaces, and a large sunny south facing balcony. Early viewing of this beautiful apartment is highly recommended.\n \nThe accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hall with hot press and large storage closet. The living/ dining room is bright and spacious and features a sunny south facing balcony. The kitchen is open plan to the living/ dining room, has been upgraded and comes with integrated appliances. The first double bedroom comes with a fitted wardrobe and own ensuite. There is a second double bedroom with a fitted wardrobe, and the third bedroom is a good size and complete with fitted wardrobe. The fully tiled bathroom completes the pictures of this superb home. The property benefits from two designated parking spaces - one underground and one surface level.\n \nTemple Gardens is located in the Northwood development in Santry, with every conceivable amenity close by including shops, schools, sporting and recreational facilities. Gulliver's Retail Park is located just a short walk from the property and will be able to provide the purchaser with a wealth of retail outlets. The property is also located parallel to Santry Park which offers over 75 acres of stunning parkland that the discerning purchaser will be able to enjoy. The M1, M50, Dublin Airport and city centre are all within easy reach of the property.\n\nIf you would like a viewing of this property, please email us at Drumcondra@sherryfitz.ie or call the office directly on 018373737 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.98m x 1.06m\nWelcoming entrance hall with wood flooring, large storage press, hot press, intercom, and recessed lighting.\n\nLiving/ Dining Room - 6.76m x 4.38m\nLarge open plan room with wood flooring and door to large sunny south facing balcony.\n\nKitchen - 2.80m x 2.48m\nWith wall and floor units, tiled splashback, oven, four ring gas hob, integrated fridge freezer and washing machine, and recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.64m x 2.90m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite - 1.82m x 1.66m\nFully tiled ensuite with wc, wash hand basin over cabinet, shower and extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.24m x 3.20m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.20m x 2.42m\nSpacious bedroom with wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.48m x 1.88m\nFully tiled modern bathroom with wc, wash hand basin over cabinet, large walk in shower with rainforest head, and extractor fan.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superb three bedroom third floor apartment</li><li>Presented in excellent condition </li><li>Both bathrooms renovated</li><li>Energy efficient B2 BER</li><li>Gas fired central heating (new boiler c.2025)</li><li>Sunny south facing balcony </li><li>Two designated parking spaces</li><li>Intercom</li><li>Lift</li><li>Excellent location close to abundance of amenities</li><li>Short drive to M1, M50 and Dublin Airport</li><li>Management fee 3,010p/a</ul>"
      },
